      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Secret Management**\n\nOkay, I'm setting up a Python script, `parse_json_secret.py`, to handle JSON secrets. I've decided to use Google Cloud Secret Manager as my secret management solution. This is a critical first step for defining external dependencies.\n\n\n**Implementing Secret Retrieval**\n\nI've created the `parse_json_secret.py` file and am implementing the Google Cloud Secret Manager integration. Imports and the client initialization are done. The next step is a function to retrieve the JSON secret and parse it. I'm focusing on handling potential errors during the retrieval and parsing to make it robust.\n\n\n",
