        "text": "**Defining Secret Retrieval**\n\nI'm solidifying the intent to create `fetch_db_secret.py`, with runtime secret fetching. I've decided on Google Secret Manager as the provider and will incorporate its identifying information into the code.\n\n\n**Implementing Secret Retrieval**\n\nI'm now focused on the code itself for `fetch_db_secret.py`. It's going to use the Google Cloud Secret Manager client library to fetch the secret at runtime. This will include provider-specific elements like importing `google.cloud.secretmanager_v1` and using the `SecretManagerServiceClient`. The focus now is on translating the high-level plan into concrete code blocks.\n\n\n",
